<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 631.02, down 3.09.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.07.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 316 to 246.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 29,836,285 compared with 24,577,330 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
